"- Review suggestions to [minimize job usage](minimize-time).\n"
"- Understand the [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"- Matuto tungkol sa [mga instance](/guides/instances).\n"
"- Tingnan ang mga mungkahi para sa [pagbabawas ng paggamit ng job](minimize-time).\n"
"- Unawain ang [fair-share scheduler](/guides/fair-share-scheduler).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
